<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia seeks 50,000 tonnes of corn -trade.</title>
<headline>Tunisia seeks 50,000 tonnes of corn -trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia launched a tender for the purchase on Wednesday of two lots of corn of 25,000 tonnes each, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>Shipment dates are January 1-10 and January 20-31 1997.</p>
</text>
